{title: Gods Grace}
{key: Eb}

{comment: Verse 1}
[Eb]How did I make it all these years?
[Cm]How did I make it this far?
[Ab]Through the valleys and over the hills
[Bb]I know it had to be God
[Eb]How did I make it through the storm?
[Cm]How did I make it through the rain?
[Ab]If you want to know
[Ab]Just how I got here
[Bb]It's so easy to explain

{comment: Chorus}
[Eb]It was God's grace (God's grace)
[Cm]It was God's grace (God's grace)
[Ab]It was God's grace (God's grace)
[Ab/C]It was God's grace (God's grace)
[Fm]I made it this far (I made it this far)
By the [Cm/Eb]grace of  [Bb]God (by the grace of God)

{comment: Verse 2}
[Eb]Lord, I thank you for how you brought me
[C]How you brought me through the night
[Ab]Lord, you kept me and you never left me
[Bb]You stood by my side
[Eb]There were so many times when I came so close
[C]Old man's death, he tried to take me in
[Ab]So the reason I'm here
[Ab/C]It's not hard for me to see
[Bb]In fact, it so easy for me to explain

{comment: Tag}
[Ab]I remember the [Bb]times when I s[Cm]trayed away
[Ab]Even though I [Bb]knew the word
[Cm]Still I wouldn't obey
[Ab]But God's mercy and his [Ab/C]grace stayed with me
[Ab/Eb]And brought me, brought me all the [Bb]way
